/**
 * gh.ts — thin wrappers around the `gh` CLI and `git`. The one canonical
 * copy shared by every script and MCP server in this repo (workflow-invoked
 * `src/scripts/**` and Atoma-tool-invoked `src/atoma/tools/scripts/**`
